     "said": [
      "The model testing in Table 2 suggests that abundance and flower handling behavior (B) are significant predictors of seed set.",
      "(2015) agreed qualitatively on the flower handling behavior exhibited by specific bee taxa, and where they disagreed quantitatively (e.g."
