      "measured": 0.984,
      "literature": 0.016
     },
     "said": [
      "Other functional traits In addition to floral handling, we tested two other functional traits: pollen purity and bee body size (Fig.",
      "We define pollen purity as the proportion of the pollen load consisting of apple pollen relative to pollen of other species."
     ],
     "value": "measured"
    },
    "Body Length (mm)": {
     "choice": "literature",
     "probs": {
      "measured": 0.061,
      "literature": 0.939
     },
     "said": [
      "We collected data from the literature on body length of each bee species (Mitchell, 1960) and measured the intertegular distances of the fieldcollected bees for the purposes of this study.",
      "As intertegular distances in this case were highly correlated with body length values (see supplemental materials), we found little difference in the analyses resulting from these two measures."
     ],
     "value": "literature"
    }
